OL,3,GNEWSAFormer police officer in court
OL,4,Acharged with raping woman while on duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police officer has appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt charged with raping and
OL,8,Fstrangling a woman while on duty.
OL,10,FRikki Hall, 33, from Swansea and who
OL,11,Fworked as a constable for South Wales
OL,12,FPolice, attended Bristol Magistrates'
OL,13,FCourt on Thursday.
OL,15,FHe was charged with two counts of rape
OL,16,Fand one of the intentional
OL,17,Fstrangulation of a woman, causing her
OL,18,Fto have difficulty breathing in
OL,19,FFebruary 2024.
OL,21,FNo formal pleas were entered during the
OL,22,Fhearing.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
